  m_text: "\r\rTURN STRUCTURE:\r\n1.) Start step (Mandatory): Choose ONE action:\r\n\r\nPlace,
    Delete or Connect.\r\n\r\n2.) End Step (Optional):\r\n\r\nUse \"Move\" to move
    one of your Symbols OR skip to end your turn by clicking turn marker.\n\r\nMOVE
    -\r\t    Click the MOVE button below your DeleteBoard to enter move mode\r\n\r\nYour
    movable symbols will highlight (basic and origin symbols)\r\n\r\nSelect one of
    your highlighted symbols. Valid destination cells will appear.\r\n\r\nMove in
    any direction for 1 space\r\t\t\t\t\t      . Can jump over terrain \r\n\r\r\n\rCannot
    land on occupied cells.\r\r\n\r\nEach player has 5 Move actions per game. The
    player who goes first starts with 4 Moves (instead of 5) "
